# The work_items table is the Go <-> Python contract (ADR-0001): Go enqueues, Python
# claims. Both sides' contract tests compare the migrated table to this file
# (column, data type, nullable), so a column changed on one side fails the other.
# Change it only with a migration and an ADR.
id bigint NO
posting_id bigint NO
kind text NO
content_hash bytea NO
state text NO
attempts integer NO
max_attempts integer NO
run_after timestamp with time zone NO
locked_until timestamp with time zone YES
claim_token uuid YES
last_error text YES
created_at timestamp with time zone NO
updated_at timestamp with time zone NO
